This repository contains independent benchmark orchestration and documentation.
It is not an official VBench or vLLM-Omni distribution.

VBench prompt/metadata snapshots under data/ originate from Vchitect/VBench:
https://github.com/Vchitect/VBench
They retain their upstream terms; see data/README.md and the upstream repository.
This repository does not relicense third-party datasets, model weights, images,
generated videos, evaluator checkpoints, or externally downloaded source code.

Inference and scoring import the separately installed upstream projects:
vLLM-Omni: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-omni
VBench: https://github.com/Vchitect/VBench
AutoRound: https://github.com/intel/auto-round